{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31580","headline":"寄长沙许侍御 · 李羣玉","name":"寄长沙许侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三年文会许追随，和徧南朝杂体诗。\n未把彩毫还郭璞，乞留残锦与丘迟。\n竹斋琴酒欢成梦，水寺烟霞赏对谁。\n今日秋风满湘浦，秪应搔首咏琼枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31580.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31580","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}